    {"tool": "sense_blast", "query": "Batch (file batch.go)", "note": "record.Writer via flusher -> bench.pebbleDB (record/record.go:673) — the flusher is an I/O sync flusher, not a DB; the chain is a via_satisfiers artifact, a false positive"}
